# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# secrets — the API key lives in the environment, never in the repo
.env

# raw wordlist downloads (13MB; re-fetch via scripts/import_wordlist.py URLs)
data/raw/

# per-learner runtime data (private: journal-derived profiles and SRS state)
data/profiles/*.json
data/srs/

# generated eval reports (re-runnable; keep the set, not the outputs)
evals/reports/*.json

# Source material the learner supplied for reference — copyrighted textbooks
# (TalkTalk English © TTEC LLC 2022; "Boldoo's english lesson"), 538MB of
# scans and PDFs. Read to learn what Mongolian learners are actually taught;
# never committed — they are 538MB and the app does not need them.
#
# Note: boldoo/content/lessons.js contains a transcription of pages 6–22 of
# "Boldoo's english lesson", because the study app is built from it. The repo
# owner has chosen to publish that transcription; only the scans are excluded
# here. Attribution for the source book is in boldoo/README.md.
BE_Lesson/
TalkTalk/

# Design bundle for the Small Step interface — 1.7MB, kept locally.
# The visual system it encodes is described in boldoo/README.md.
boldoo/Zam - English Study App.html
